Subject: [PATCH 2/2] feat(job-offers): reopen closed job offers from the
 history

- Add jobOffersService.reopen and useReopenJobOffer, refreshing the company offers.
- Confirm with the shared ConfirmDialog showing the offer title (HU6-4, HU6-5, HU6-26).
- Disable the button and show a spinner while reopening (HU6-11, HU6-19).
- Stay in the history: the badge changes to Activa and the offer leaves the Cerradas filter (HU6-7, HU6-14, HU6-15, HU6-25).
- Explain a 409 when the offer changed status before confirming (HU6-27).

